{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile setting, using PCA-encoded RNA, ResNet50 image features, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6186 (vs 0.5266 in singleprofile baseline) suggests multiprofile integration may yield performance gains. Uncertainty remains about the specific contributions of aggregation/fusion strategies and whether multi-profile benefits persist under varying configurations."
}

